{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：08:41 2026-06-03 HKT</p>\n<p>今（3日）清晨約6時半，一名中年男子在大埔富善邨停車場上層墮下，倒臥停車場平台位置。消防接報趕到，惟男子已當場死亡。</p>\n<p>警方沒有檢獲遺書，經調查後證實死者是44歲姓何男子，相信他受工作問題困擾，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p>\n<img alt=\"男事主當場不治。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/adb4a8c3b28c30f2749fc9d1cbc6284d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_08_31_26_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0bb10fc9df08906c2dea431b576f6bb6/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_08_31_28.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子在停車場上層墮下。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9ba73e3710497d642ac7bec4362704b8/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_08_31_26_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7e39cb4f4101985318bc2e413fc76a5f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_08_31_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5f7cf5305c1bc1ebe8c4f9e7eb1f1034/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_08_31_25.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T03:40:28.140272+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}